{"seq":2,"slug":"core-techniques","title":"核心技术","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/molecular-gastronomy/core-techniques","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"spherification","title":"球化技术","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/molecular-gastronomy/core-techniques/spherification","wordCount":2171,"readingTime":9},{"seq":2,"slug":"emulsification-foam","title":"乳化与泡沫","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/molecular-gastronomy/core-techniques/emulsification-foam","wordCount":2151,"readingTime":9},{"seq":3,"slug":"sous-vide","title":"低温慢煮与真空烹饪","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cooking-food-science/molecular-gastronomy/core-techniques/sous-vide","wordCount":2327,"readingTime":10}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"核心技术\">核心技术</h1><p>如果说第一章是&quot;知其然&quot;的科学基础，本章则是&quot;知其所以然&quot;的技术落地。球化技术利用海藻酸钠与钙离子的交联反应，将液态食材包裹在薄膜中形成&quot;爆珠&quot;口感；乳化与泡沫借助卵磷脂等表面活性剂，将油与水、空气与液体的不稳定混合物变成可塑的质地；低温慢煮与真空烹饪则通过精确的温度控制和无氧环境，实现传统烹饪无法企及的均匀熟度与风味保留。每一项技术都建立在第一章的科学原理之上，同时为第三章的风味质地讨论提供技术手段。</p>\n"}